"available primitives"
msgstr ""
"Introdução às primitivas no Qiskit Runtime e uma explicação das primitivas "
"disponíveis"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives"
msgstr "Introdução às primitivas"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to primitives {#introduction-to-primitives}"
msgstr "Introdução às primitivas {#introduction-to-primitives}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Primitives were created to simplify the most common tasks for quantum "
"computers: namely, sampling quantum states and calculating expectation "
"values. The first Qiskit Runtime primitives "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) and "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) are implementations of the Qiskit [primitives base "
"classes](/guides/primitives). They provide a more sophisticated "
"implementation (for example, by including error mitigation) as a cloud-based"
" service and are used to access IBM Quantum&reg; hardware.\n"
msgstr ""
"As primitivas foram criadas para simplificar as tarefas mais comuns em "
"computadores quânticos: nomeadamente, amostrar estados quânticos e calcular "
"valores esperados. As primeiras primitivas do Qiskit Runtime "
"([`EstimatorV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/estimator-v2) e "
"[`SamplerV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/sampler-v2)) são implementações das [classes base de "
"primitivas](/guides/primitives) do Qiskit. Elas oferecem uma implementação "
"mais sofisticada (por exemplo, incluindo mitigação de erros) como serviço "
"baseado em nuvem e são usadas para acessar o hardware IBM Quantum&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The newest Qiskit Runtime primitive, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) "
"(which is in beta), provides a lower-level interface that gives more "
"visibility and control without sacrificing performance.\n"
msgstr ""
"A primitiva mais recente do Qiskit Runtime, "
"[Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor) (em"
" beta), fornece uma interface de nível mais baixo que oferece maior "
"visibilidade e controle sem sacrificar o desempenho.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Computes the expectation values for one or more observables with respect to states prepared by quantum circuits.  Has built-in error suppression and mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"<CardGroup>\n"
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Estimator\"\n"
"      description=\"Calcula os valores esperados para um ou mais observáveis em relação aos estados preparados por Circuits quânticos. Possui métodos integrados de supressão e mitigação de erros.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-estimator\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Estimator quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Início rápido do Estimator\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples the output register from the execution of one or more quantum circuits.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Card\n"
"      title=\"Sampler\"\n"
"      description=\"Amostra o registrador de saída da execução de um ou mais Circuits quânticos.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-sampler\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Sampler quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Início rápido do Sampler\"\n"
"    />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Samples output registers from quantum circuit executions based on input directives and gives you full control and transparency over customizing error mitigation methods.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <Card\n"
"      title=\"Executor (beta)\"\n"
"      description=\"Amostra registradores de saída de execuções de Circuit quântico com base em diretivas de entrada e oferece controle total e transparência sobre a personalização dos métodos de mitigação de erros.\"\n"
"      href=\"/guides/get-started-with-executor\"\n"
"      analyticsName=\"Executor quickstart\"\n"
"      linkText=\"Início rápido do Executor\"\n"
"    />\n"
"</CardGroup>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos passos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn about the [Qiskit primitives](/guides/primitives) that the Qiskit Runtime primitives are based on.\n"
"- Review detailed [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples), or [Executor](/guides/executor-examples) examples.\n"
"- See the input and output details for [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output), and [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- See the [EstimatorV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [SamplerV2 API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2), and [Executor API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Read [Migrate to V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendações\">\n"
"- Saiba mais sobre as [primitivas Qiskit](/guides/primitives) nas quais as primitivas do Qiskit Runtime se baseiam.\n"
"- Revise exemplos detalhados de [Estimator](/guides/estimator-examples), [Sampler](/guides/sampler-examples) ou [Executor](/guides/executor-examples).\n"
"- Veja os detalhes de entrada e saída do [Estimator](/guides/estimator-input-output), [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) e [Sampler](/guides/sampler-input-output).\n"
"- Pratique com primitivas trabalhando na [lição de função de custo](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) no IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Consulte a [referência da API EstimatorV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/estimator-v2), [referência da API SamplerV2](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) e [referência da API Executor](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/executor).\n"
"- Leia [Migrar para primitivas V2](/guides/v2-primitives).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
